notes:        Color workspace: Lumetri Scopes (RGB parade and waveform) on the left, the Program monitor on the graded dunes frame, the Lumetri Color panel with Basic Correction open on the right, and the timeline below. 1600x900. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
